※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4903 LANG_CLAUSE_POST_OVER_TYPES

※ A requirement is a fact about types and does not happen at a point in the
※ call, so it belongs to `pre`.  A `post` is always a condition.

fn total(a: T') → T' post(T' ⊞ T' → T'):
    a

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    ⎕narrow(total(3u8), ⌜u6⌝) ?? 1u6
